The agent role prompts in backend/cowcrew/agents/prompts/*.md are adapted
from Squid's agents/*.md files (product-architect, software-engineer, tester,
pr-reviewer, oncall-engineer). They were modified for CowCrew: the
orchestrator owns commits, pushes and file writes for the plan, agents return
structured JSON, and tracker/GitHub-issue steps were removed. The pipeline
shape (grill -> groom -> SWE/Tester loop -> PA acceptance -> PR review -> CI
with On-Call, with two human gates) follows Squid's squid-plan,
squid-implement-task, squid-review and squid-review-ci skills.

